ZPlanKit changelog

1.39.3 (2026-10-09)
  Planner (czplan.c):
  - The EAD column honours O2 narcotic. On a helium mix it prints the END
    (oxygen counted when O2 narcotic is on); on a helium-free mix it stays
    the nitrogen-only EAD, as MultiDeco does. Before, the column was always
    nitrogen-only: 90 m on 11/57 with O2 narcotic on printed 30 m, not 33 m.
  - A GasSw row is printed only when no stop follows at the switch depth.
    When there is one, the stop row carries the new gas: 21 m EAN50 and
    9 m EAN80 now print once instead of a 0:00 GasSw row plus the stop.
    Stop list, run time, CNS, OTU and gas totals unchanged.
  Regression set unchanged (ZHL-16C 80, VVAL-79 8, VPM-B).
  Copied to Lplanner-FDroid/engine (was 1.39.0). Lplanner-Android compiles
  this checkout directly. Both apps 1.9.2.

1.39.2 (2026-10-08)
  Planner (czplan.c):
  - Waypoint profiles are now checked against the ceiling. Waypoints are
    still flown exactly as entered and no stops are added between them,
    but when an ascent between waypoints breaks the ceiling the report
    warns, naming the leg and how far it went:
      ZHL-16C: the highest GF reached, against GF high (100% without GF).
      VVAL-79: metres above the ceiling.
    VPM-B is not checked yet.
    A tester entered 90 m / 20 min on 11/57 followed by stops at 36, 18, 9
    and 6 m as waypoints. The plan came out with no warning, yet the leg
    from 18 to 9 m reaches GF 250% against GF high 87%.
    Regression set unchanged (ZHL-16C, VVAL-79 and VPM-B).
  The vendored engine copies in Lplanner-Android and Lplanner-FDroid are
  not updated.

1.39.1 (2026-09-29)
  Planner (czplan.c):
  - During the ascent the gas and setpoint are now checked at every grid
    depth, including depths where no stop is needed. The switch is made on
    the fly at the switch depth, so the diver reaches the next stop already
    on the new gas. Before, the check waited for a stop: 45 m / 20 min air
    at GF 20/95 with EAN50 switched at 18 m instead of 21 m.
    Stop lists unchanged over the regression set; CNS and OTU rise slightly
    on 4 of 96 rows because the switch comes earlier.
  The vendored engine copies in Lplanner-Android and Lplanner-FDroid are
  not updated.
  The dive computer engine (zp_rt) lives in its own repository,
  DiveComputerEngine, next to this one.
